#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install the IBM Quantum Compute client {#install-the-ibm-quantum-compute-"
"client}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Quantum Compute Service is the cloud-based service for executing quantum"
" computations on IBM Quantum&reg; hardware. This guide shows you how to "
"install `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, which is the client package for accessing IBM "
"Quantum Compute Service.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before installing the `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, follow the instructions in these"
" guides:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit). \n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Set up your IBM Cloud account](cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run this command to install the IBM Quantum Compute client:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Stay current with the latest versions\">\n"
"Periodically check the [`qiskit-ibm-runtime` release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes) to see new releases. We recommend frequently updating your requirements for `qiskit-ibm-runtime` by running `pip install -U qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr ""

